*.iml
/.idea/
/target/
/logs/
# Profiling artifacts stay entirely local. Recordings alone have reached ~140 MB for a
# single round, and nothing under here is the record of a result: findings belong in
# PROFILING-LOG.md, with the numbers written into the entry rather than left implicit in
# a data file. A consequence worth knowing: derived JSON and results.jsonl are ignored
# too, so a round's raw data does NOT survive a clean checkout -- quote the numbers in
# the log entry while the data is still on disk, because it will not be there later.
# (/profiling/* already covers subdirectories; the two patterns below are belt-and-braces
# in case that line is ever narrowed.)
/profiling/*
/profiling/**/*.jfr
/profiling/**/*.console.log
/.java-version
/tools/bench/*.jar
/tools/bench/*.conf
/tools/bench/out/drive
